{"asset_key":"ep7/herohub_story_17411150","episode":"ep7","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"17411150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1741115001:1":{"text":"귀네스, 벌써 10분째 나를 빤히 보고 있잖아!","source_cn":"格温妮丝，你已经盯着我看了十分钟了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2165B1D8C367B3DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1741115002:1":{"text":"어머, 그래? 미안해, 여우야...","source_cn":"哎，是吗？抱歉，小狐狸，是我失礼了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D0E73DB509E5C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1741115003:1":{"text":"그냥 네가 어떻게 움직이는지 관찰하고 있었어. 네가 어디서 왔는지 알 수 없으니까, 근위대원인 나는 경계해야 하거든.","source_cn":"我的本意只是在观察你的行为模式，毕竟你来历不明，作为守...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B8D78544F8D4444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1741115004:1":{"text":"어이, 어이! 그게 빤히 보는 것보다 사람... 아니, 여우한테 더 상처가 되는 말이거든?!","source_cn":"喂喂喂！这个回答可比直接盯着我看更伤人……不对，更伤狐啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7885AC7A73DBCAB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1741115005:1":{"text":"네 털은 아주 윤기 있고 부드러워 보이네. 귀도 뾰족하고, 꼬리는 구름처럼 폭신해 보여... 만지면 감촉이 아주 좋을 것 같아...","source_cn":"小狐狸的毛色看起来很柔顺，耳朵尖尖的，尾巴蓬松得像云朵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1DE43954FF08FB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","var